            representing true.
          %h3#untruncated_excluded_middle Untruncated excluded middle
          %p There is also an untruncated version of excluded middle, which uses the sum type instead of the disjunction:
          .maruku-equation
            %math.maruku-mathml{:display => "block", :xmlns => "http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"}
