            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/set-theoretic+axiom+of+choice"} set-theoretic axiom of choice
            in addition to
            = succeed "," do
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/excluded+middle"} excluded middle
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/types"} types
            is the
            = succeed "," do
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/type-theoretic+choice+operator"} type-theoretic choice operator
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/UIP"} UIP
            in addition to the set-theoretic axiom of choice and excluded middle.
          %p
