          %h3#contractible_excluded_middle Contractible excluded middle
          %p
            There is also a version of excluded middle, which uses
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/contractible+type"} contractibility
            instead of
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/pointed+type"} pointedness
            to express
            = succeed ":" do
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/truth"} truth
          .maruku-equation
            %math.maruku-mathml{:display => "block", :xmlns => "http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"}
              %semantics
                %mrow
                  %mfrac
                    %mrow
                      %mi Γ
                      %mo ⊢
