            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/h-proposition"} h-proposition
            is also necessary. This alternate law of untruncated excluded middle for general types implies that every type is a
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/h-proposition"} h-proposition
