              %semantics
                %mrow
                  %mi P
                  %mo +
                  %mo ¬
                  %mi P
                %annotation{:encoding => "application/x-tex"} P + \neg P
            is equivalent to the unit type are the
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/empty+type"} empty type
            and the
            = succeed "," do
