          %p
            Similarly as above, if the type theory has a
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/type+of+booleans"} type of booleans
            %math.maruku-mathml{:display => "inline", :xmlns => "http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"}
